[Options]

[A.]
<h2><i>                              ~[Ipriest.C6]</i> LOOK OUT! <i>~[Ipriest.C3]</i></h2><br>

<i>"But, master Sun Lord, even with your generous bestowal of knowledge, I
am no match against the powers of Rain!"                                            --mosquito<br><br>
<i>"Be quiet, you groveling fool. Fight like the true Nimbian you pretend to be!"<br>                     
                                                                                        --Sun God</i><br>
<p>
Congrats! The Sun God has taken a liking to you, Although still in
training, you are now considered as one of the WITLESS<br>
(<i><h2>W</i/h2>arriors <i><h2>I</i/h2>n <i><h2>T</i/h2>raining <i><h2>L</i/h2>earning <i><h2>E</i/h2>ver <i><h2>S</i/h2>o <i><h2>S</i/h2>lowly)<br>
<p>
The Rain Fury has become interested in your development.. He sends out
one of his best warriors to test you...<br>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Leave Mission,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Sun Fury</h2>
<p>
The sun god is very happy, he sends you knowledge
<i>~[IsunBlocker.3]</i>
keep on fighting!


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You've defeated the enemy! The Sun Fury is esctatic!
He has given you all of his knowledge..
<i>~[IsunBlocker.3]  ~[IsunBalloon]</i>

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,gainpwr



[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Oh no! Mr. Rainman was too much for you!  This cannot be! You must continue
to fight!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]
